WEBVTT

00:00.370 --> 00:02.070
Yeah, that's it!

00:02.070 --> 00:04.980
Oh, you put too many dots on that letter.

00:04.980 --> 00:07.140
I-I know that!

00:07.140 --> 00:09.490
Calm your heart before you write.

00:09.840 --> 00:13.330
Okay, I get it. 
Let me write alone for a while.

00:14.270 --> 00:16.240
You're doing great!

00:16.240 --> 00:18.370
You can take your time.

00:20.330 --> 00:23.130
I did it! This looks good, right?!

00:23.530 --> 00:28.120
Uh, but that's not "apple." It's "apply."

00:30.650 --> 00:34.070
Th-That's right! I was testing you!

00:34.070 --> 00:35.850
I'm impressed you noticed!

00:35.850 --> 00:38.770
Okay, let's practice it one more time!

00:38.770 --> 00:40.380
Oh, fine.

00:40.610 --> 00:44.390
This is so great! 
It's like I have a new daughter!

00:44.750 --> 00:47.540
I am not your daughter!

00:47.540 --> 00:49.140
Don't be so weird!

00:49.140 --> 00:52.510
Oh, I like that, too! 
It's like she's in her rebellious phase!

00:52.510 --> 00:55.160
Falfa and Shalsha were such 
good kids, I never had that!

00:55.880 --> 00:58.360
Well, Mama's going to go do some laundry.

00:58.360 --> 01:00.480
Keep up the studying, okay?

01:00.480 --> 01:01.660
Okay!

01:04.160 --> 01:06.750
Add my special witch-made detergent, and...

01:07.110 --> 01:09.270
Wind, blow!

01:16.330 --> 01:18.960
Hup! Spin cycle!

01:19.850 --> 01:21.670
And then we dry.

01:23.940 --> 01:25.580
Piece of cake!

01:26.380 --> 01:27.310
Mother.

01:28.620 --> 01:30.820
Shalsha? What is it?

01:31.930 --> 01:33.930
I have a proposal.

01:34.450 --> 01:36.710
Oh? A proposal, eh?

01:37.100 --> 01:41.190
My sister and I have studied 
on our own up until now.

01:41.500 --> 01:44.080
Since Sandra joined us,

01:44.080 --> 01:47.090
it feels like our learning has 
expanded to a new level.

01:47.430 --> 01:49.090
So I thought...

01:49.450 --> 01:53.580
Sandra, my sister, and I all have 
the appearance of children.

01:53.950 --> 01:57.160
So by becoming part of an 
environment with more children,

01:57.160 --> 02:00.470
perhaps we could make even 
more new discoveries.

02:00.720 --> 02:04.810
Are you saying... you want to go to school?

02:04.810 --> 02:05.740
Yes.

02:14.570 --> 02:25.580
<b>I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2</b>

03:35.990 --> 03:39.490
<b>Provincial Capital Vitamei</b>

03:39.490 --> 03:43.490
<b>Senale Elementary Academy</b>

03:43.830 --> 03:46.370
I'm Falfa! Nice to meet you!

03:45.120 --> 03:48.290
<b>I Became Momma Yufufu's Daughter</b>

03:46.370 --> 03:49.090
I'm Shalsha. My sister and I are twins.

03:49.530 --> 03:50.870
Sandra.

03:50.870 --> 03:54.380
Play nicely with your 
new friends, everyone.

03:54.680 --> 03:56.710
Okay!

03:57.550 --> 03:59.730
<i>I was so worried, I came to check on them.</i>

03:59.730 --> 04:01.820
<i>I hope they'll all fit in.</i>

04:02.130 --> 04:05.130
All right, let's start with this problem.

04:05.130 --> 04:07.630
Okay! I'm done!

04:07.940 --> 04:10.650
Oh? That was fast.

04:10.650 --> 04:12.260
All right, next...

04:12.650 --> 04:15.020
Okay! I'm done!

04:15.360 --> 04:18.020
Huh?! That was fast...

04:18.320 --> 04:19.300
All right...

04:19.300 --> 04:20.780
Done!

04:20.780 --> 04:22.870
O-Okay, next...

04:22.870 --> 04:24.560
Done!

04:24.560 --> 04:26.030
Well, then...

04:27.900 --> 04:29.690
Done!

04:32.870 --> 04:34.640
Impossible...

04:34.640 --> 04:37.170
That's a university-level problem!

04:37.650 --> 04:40.680
Math on that level is no 
problem for my sister.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.200
She's a genius...

04:42.580 --> 04:44.170
Wow...

04:44.430 --> 04:47.170
<i>They're not fitting in, 
and in ways I didn't expect!</i>

04:54.380 --> 04:56.680
Shalsha, pass it here!

04:57.040 --> 04:58.440
Very well.

05:01.180 --> 05:05.230
Shalsha, you have to pass 
it so she can catch it.

05:05.770 --> 05:07.830
Controlling my strength is hard.

05:07.830 --> 05:09.710
You're absolutely barbaric.

05:09.710 --> 05:11.790
That was so fast...

05:11.790 --> 05:13.700
They're good at athletic stuff, too?

05:14.060 --> 05:17.260
<i>They're drawing the wrong kind 
of attention here, too!</i>

05:17.720 --> 05:20.200
Hmph! It was just a fluke.

05:20.200 --> 05:22.590
Quit passing it around
 and try throwing it at me!

05:23.810 --> 05:24.880
Very well.

05:24.880 --> 05:27.380
<i>No! Wait, Shalsha!</i>

05:36.590 --> 05:37.730
Yay!

05:37.730 --> 05:39.840
You're amazing, Shalsha!

05:40.410 --> 05:42.610
Don't let her get the ball.

05:42.610 --> 05:44.690
Go for someone weaker.

05:45.130 --> 05:46.490
Okay, her!

05:46.490 --> 05:47.060
Huh?!

05:47.060 --> 05:47.990
Take this!

05:48.540 --> 05:49.470
Sandra!

05:49.660 --> 05:51.910
Eek! Danger!

05:54.030 --> 05:55.700
She went underground?

05:55.700 --> 05:57.130
Sandra?

05:58.920 --> 06:00.120
What?

06:00.120 --> 06:02.210
Whoa, that's so cool!

06:02.210 --> 06:03.430
How do you do that?

06:03.430 --> 06:05.120
I wanna do it, too!

06:05.400 --> 06:10.140
<i>They stick out like sore thumbs, 
but... I guess they're okay?</i>

06:10.220 --> 06:13.640
<b>A Few Days Later</b>

06:10.910 --> 06:13.630
So that's what happened.

06:13.630 --> 06:16.430
They caused a huge scene at school.

06:16.430 --> 06:18.630
Momma Yufufu, are you listening?

06:18.630 --> 06:20.760
Yes, I'm listening.

06:20.760 --> 06:25.140
After that, once Falfa and 
Shalsha's classes were over...

06:25.520 --> 06:30.000
There's nothing more I can 
teach Falfa and Shalsha,

06:30.000 --> 06:32.220
so they will be graduating.

06:32.220 --> 06:33.650
What?!

06:33.650 --> 06:36.060
We've had so much fun with all of you!

06:36.060 --> 06:38.420
Learning cannot be done only at a desk.

06:38.420 --> 06:43.260
I learned a broad range of values through 
the free thinking unique to children.

06:44.330 --> 06:46.430
I guess it can't be helped, huh?

06:47.290 --> 06:48.540
That's too bad.

06:48.860 --> 06:53.120
They said they might be able 
to teach Sandra, at least,

06:53.120 --> 06:58.720
but Sandra doesn't really open up to 
anyone but me, Falfa, and Shalsha.

06:59.040 --> 07:02.200
I wish she'd be a little more friendly...

07:02.490 --> 07:03.930
Indeed.

07:04.370 --> 07:08.940
Ah, I just don't understand 
the way my daughters think.

07:10.350 --> 07:13.080
All right, Azusa, it's ready.

07:13.740 --> 07:16.210
Wow, it looks great!

07:16.500 --> 07:19.270
Since you came all the 
way out here to visit,

07:19.270 --> 07:21.600
I put all my cooking skills to the test.

07:21.600 --> 07:23.210
Now, let's eat.

07:23.210 --> 07:26.110
Yeah! Let's dig in!

07:30.190 --> 07:31.720
It's delicious!

07:31.720 --> 07:33.680
It's the taste of home!

07:33.680 --> 07:35.970
Just like my parents used to make!

07:35.970 --> 07:38.730
You're too good a mom, Momma Yufufu!

07:40.170 --> 07:43.470
It makes me happy to hear 
you call me "Momma," too.

07:43.820 --> 07:46.070
This really is good, though!

07:46.070 --> 07:49.230
Hey, Momma, what's this mushroom called?

07:49.570 --> 07:51.810
The flavor seems familiar somehow.

07:52.520 --> 07:54.940
That's a gnome-maker mushroom.

07:54.940 --> 07:57.860
Isn't the crisp texture delightful?

07:57.860 --> 08:00.180
Gnome-maker mushroom?

08:00.180 --> 08:02.550
I've heard that name somewhere before...

08:06.800 --> 08:08.740
Oh, my! Oh, my!

08:08.740 --> 08:11.510
You've turned absolutely adorable!

08:11.510 --> 08:14.180
No wonder it tasted familiar.

08:14.180 --> 08:17.520
I ate some before, 
and it caused a lot of trouble.

08:17.830 --> 08:19.330
I'm sorry.

08:19.330 --> 08:21.840
I didn't know eating them 
caused humans to shrink.

08:21.840 --> 08:24.520
I should have checked first.

08:24.870 --> 08:28.890
I mean, I know how to fix it, 
so it's okay, but...

08:30.400 --> 08:36.540
Hey, Azusa, would you allow me to be 
your mom for real? Just for a while?

08:36.810 --> 08:37.850
Huh?

08:37.850 --> 08:41.670
But I've thought of you as my mom 
whenever I've been with you all this time.

08:41.670 --> 08:45.810
Just as a daughter who's back 
home for a visit, right?

08:45.810 --> 08:49.080
But right now, we look like a 
mother and her young daughter!

08:49.650 --> 08:50.920
Yeah, but...

08:51.570 --> 08:56.040
You said you didn't understand the way 
Falfa and Shalsha thought, right?

08:56.290 --> 09:00.280
So why not try becoming 
a daughter yourself?

09:00.280 --> 09:03.260
I mean, it's a good idea, but...

09:07.100 --> 09:09.610
Oh, I'm sorry!

09:09.610 --> 09:12.490
I forgot I'm a droplet spirit.

09:13.350 --> 09:18.370
Momma Yufufu, you just want to be a 
mom to a young daughter, don't you?

09:19.510 --> 09:20.750
Figured me out, huh?

09:20.750 --> 09:22.490
Honestly...

09:22.880 --> 09:23.810
Oh, right!

09:24.060 --> 09:27.210
In that case, I have one 
other favor to ask.

09:33.100 --> 09:35.340
Eee! Lady Azusa!

09:35.340 --> 09:37.540
You've turned small again!

09:37.540 --> 09:39.380
How adorable!

09:39.760 --> 09:41.370
I'll give you uppies!

09:41.370 --> 09:43.720
Hey! Put me down!

09:49.430 --> 09:52.860
Sandra wants to be your daughter, too.

09:52.860 --> 09:54.450
But of course!

09:54.450 --> 09:57.110
Sandra, was it? 
It would be my pleasure.

09:58.180 --> 10:00.280
So what am I supposed to do?

10:00.280 --> 10:03.400
You just need to think of 
Momma Yufufu as your mom.

10:03.780 --> 10:05.500
My mom, huh?

10:05.500 --> 10:08.410
I don't really understand all 
that since I'm a plant.

10:09.820 --> 10:10.890
Hey!

10:10.890 --> 10:14.990
You don't need to think about anything. 
Just let me baby you, Sandra.

10:17.540 --> 10:19.400
A mom, huh?

10:19.400 --> 10:22.220
I guess it is kind of calming. 
This might not be so bad.

10:22.690 --> 10:23.920
Plus...

10:24.390 --> 10:28.540
I can absorb just the right 
amount of moisture from her.

10:29.310 --> 10:32.410
<i>She's a plant getting watered...</i>

10:34.090 --> 10:37.590
All right, Momma is going to 
start preparing dinner now.

10:37.590 --> 10:39.450
Play with your big sis, okay?

10:40.150 --> 10:41.440
Big sis?

10:43.860 --> 10:46.740
All right, fine. I'll be your playmate.

10:46.740 --> 10:48.920
What a bratty little sister...

10:50.100 --> 10:52.700
Okay, do you want to play house?

10:52.930 --> 10:55.770
I'll play the town shoemaker.

10:57.180 --> 10:59.710
Then I'll be a great cedar tree.

10:59.710 --> 11:00.640
Huh?

11:00.960 --> 11:03.100
Well, okay, I guess...

11:03.790 --> 11:06.350
Ah, it's been another exhausting day!

11:06.350 --> 11:09.940
I think I'll go see that big 
cedar tree on the edge of town.

11:13.460 --> 11:16.480
That cedar tree always looks so big!

11:19.840 --> 11:24.240
I wonder how long this cedar 
tree has been growing here.

11:26.840 --> 11:30.380
Um... I'd like you to talk, 
if you wouldn't mind.

11:30.700 --> 11:33.660
Why would a great cedar tree talk?

11:33.660 --> 11:36.290
Plants are silent and tell no stories.

11:36.290 --> 11:39.250
But we can't play house that way.

11:39.570 --> 11:43.510
Oh, fine, then. Go ahead and talk to me.

11:44.620 --> 11:49.260
Cedar tree, cedar tree! 
What is your name, cedar tree?

11:49.590 --> 11:52.800
Some birds made a nest 
in my upper branches.

11:52.800 --> 11:55.270
I hope it rains soon.

11:55.590 --> 11:58.160
Um... Your name...

11:58.160 --> 12:01.260
I'll send out plenty of 
pollen again next year.

12:01.260 --> 12:03.780
Prepare yourselves, humans!

12:03.780 --> 12:06.540
That's just threatening! Converse with me!

12:06.820 --> 12:10.060
Not all cedar trees want to talk to people.

12:10.060 --> 12:12.330
Maybe not, but...

12:12.330 --> 12:16.110
Besides, this setting you've 
come up with is too lazy.

12:16.110 --> 12:19.180
I can't acknowledge you as 
my older sister this way.

12:19.830 --> 12:22.430
What a bratty little sister...

12:27.000 --> 12:31.520
I don't understand how my little sister 
thinks, much less my daughters.

12:32.170 --> 12:37.440
It's too bad Sandra doesn't take 
baths because her roots might rot.

12:37.730 --> 12:42.220
Yeah, but that means I have 
Momma all to myself right now.

12:42.220 --> 12:43.960
Enjoy me all you like.

12:45.030 --> 12:47.450
You sure have big breasts, Momma.

12:47.450 --> 12:50.420
Yours will be big when you grow up, too.

12:50.780 --> 12:52.210
Actually, no.

12:53.080 --> 12:59.030
I can't wait to see how you 
turn out when you grow up.

12:59.030 --> 13:02.490
You know a lot about plants, 
so maybe you'll be a witch?

13:02.940 --> 13:04.470
Maybe!

13:04.470 --> 13:07.490
I'd like to be a witch and just 
laze around all the time.

13:07.490 --> 13:09.970
For about 300 years, maybe.

13:09.970 --> 13:11.490
Oh, how lovely!

13:11.950 --> 13:14.860
I wonder how Sandra will turn out.

13:16.430 --> 13:19.140
Yeah, I wonder that, too...

13:21.310 --> 13:25.050
"But then something terrible happened.

13:25.050 --> 13:28.900
They couldn't find the 
onions they had set out."

13:33.400 --> 13:36.150
Oh, my. Sandra fell asleep.

13:37.590 --> 13:40.100
Children really are wonderful.

13:40.540 --> 13:44.370
I think moms are pretty wonderful, too.

13:45.650 --> 13:48.200
Rest well, my dear. Goodnight.

13:48.200 --> 13:50.490
Goodnight, Momma.

13:57.810 --> 14:00.190
<b>Provincial Capital Vitamei</b>

14:09.560 --> 14:13.200
I've always dreamed of going shopping 
in town with my daughters!

14:13.480 --> 14:15.700
There's quite a crowd.

14:15.950 --> 14:20.090
There are so many people. 
I hope none of them are witches.

14:20.430 --> 14:24.790
I guess you'd be traumatized after being 
the target of a big hunt like that.

14:24.790 --> 14:26.550
Don't you worry, Sandra.

14:26.930 --> 14:31.350
Your momma will protect 
you with her very life.

14:31.820 --> 14:34.600
Th-Thanks, Momma.

14:37.170 --> 14:39.440
What's so funny, Azusa?!

14:39.440 --> 14:41.450
Oh, nothing.

14:41.450 --> 14:45.040
Just thinking my little sister's 
face is awfully red.

14:45.040 --> 14:46.790
Wh-What's your problem?!

14:46.790 --> 14:50.360
You're my big sister! 
You're supposed to protect me, too!

14:50.360 --> 14:51.730
I know, I know.

14:53.830 --> 14:56.710
Okay, you two, here we are.

14:57.370 --> 15:00.870
Oh, my goodness! 
What adorable little children!

15:00.870 --> 15:04.250
Aren't they?! They're simply 
exploding with cuteness, aren't they?!

15:04.680 --> 15:08.370
Please come up with some outfits 
that would suit them!

15:08.820 --> 15:10.000
Momma?

15:10.260 --> 15:12.110
Of course!

15:12.110 --> 15:15.020
I'll give you all of my support!

15:15.620 --> 15:17.950
Now, let's get right to it!

15:18.500 --> 15:20.770
We'll start with this little lady.

15:23.740 --> 15:25.350
Sandra!

15:25.670 --> 15:28.230
I'll choose your outfit myself, Azusa.

15:28.550 --> 15:30.980
You're going to try on every last one!

15:34.120 --> 15:35.950
What do you think?

15:38.190 --> 15:40.060
Eee! How lovely!

15:40.060 --> 15:42.200
She's as cute as a super spirit!

15:42.200 --> 15:44.250
We'll take this outfit!

15:44.820 --> 15:47.250
It suits her perfectly!

15:48.740 --> 15:51.910
Oh, no! I'm sorry my daughter's so cute!

15:51.910 --> 15:53.750
We'll take this outfit!

15:58.260 --> 16:01.530
I am literally blinded by 
my love for this girl!

16:01.530 --> 16:03.510
We'll take this one, too!

16:08.020 --> 16:10.780
It's a straight-set win against 
the goddess of beauty!

16:10.780 --> 16:12.530
We'll take this one, too!

16:13.270 --> 16:16.110
Hey, don't I look like a princess?

16:16.110 --> 16:19.390
I feel like I could make 
all humans bow before me.

16:19.390 --> 16:22.630
Sandra's working on opening 
a brand-new door...

16:25.050 --> 16:27.050
Thank you so much!

16:31.260 --> 16:33.540
I've never worn anything like this.

16:33.540 --> 16:36.430
It looks like vibrant leaves. I like it.

16:36.430 --> 16:40.070
Anyone would agree that you 
both look like princesses!

16:44.350 --> 16:46.250
Wait here for a moment.

16:46.250 --> 16:49.060
I'll drop off our purchases at home.

16:52.840 --> 16:55.770
Boy, that magic sure is handy.

17:02.500 --> 17:04.670
Hey! What are you doing?!

17:07.260 --> 17:08.500
Okay, go!

17:12.210 --> 17:14.120
What just happened?!

17:14.570 --> 17:15.500
Shh.

17:16.950 --> 17:21.230
You little girls are dressed real nice. 
You must belong to some rich family.

17:21.570 --> 17:24.090
Are you guys kidnappers?

17:24.910 --> 17:26.340
You nailed it.

17:26.340 --> 17:31.260
We're kidnapping you so we can 
rake in a ton of ransom money.

17:31.260 --> 17:33.610
Hey, don't say too much.

17:33.610 --> 17:36.680
Oh, it's fine. They're just kids.

17:36.680 --> 17:38.860
You don't need to worry, Sandra.

17:39.730 --> 17:41.860
I'll take care of this quick.

17:52.600 --> 17:55.850
We're here. Now get out, you two.

17:56.370 --> 18:00.130
This is your base? Are your buddies inside?

18:00.130 --> 18:01.060
Yeah.

18:01.170 --> 18:04.500
So don't get any funny 
ideas about running away.

18:04.500 --> 18:05.630
Fair enough.

18:06.030 --> 18:10.010
I won't run away until I've 
made you guys suffer.

18:10.010 --> 18:11.020
Huh?

18:15.890 --> 18:19.050
Azusa, you really are strong...

18:19.560 --> 18:22.150
I'll finish this quick. Just hang tight.

18:28.240 --> 18:29.210
What the hell?!

18:36.890 --> 18:38.480
Stop right now!

18:38.480 --> 18:40.750
Or don't you care what happens to her?

18:40.750 --> 18:41.690
Sandra!

18:42.100 --> 18:44.180
B-Big Sis...

18:45.280 --> 18:47.180
That's playing dirty!

18:54.190 --> 18:56.110
You two aren't hurt, are you?!

18:56.110 --> 18:57.140
Momma!

18:57.140 --> 18:58.590
Momma Yufufu!

18:59.550 --> 19:01.870
I'm sorry you had to go 
through something so scary!

19:02.150 --> 19:04.640
Thank goodness... Thank goodness!

19:08.930 --> 19:11.470
We'll take care of it from here.

19:14.110 --> 19:16.870
I'm so glad you two are all right.

19:17.200 --> 19:19.390
Thanks for coming to save us, Momma.

19:19.630 --> 19:23.760
When they captured her, 
Sandra called me "Big Sis"!

19:23.760 --> 19:27.660
I felt like I had to do whatever 
I could to protect her.

19:28.260 --> 19:31.060
You're such a good big sister.

19:32.130 --> 19:34.290
Thank you, Azusa.

19:34.290 --> 19:37.270
All that shopping was so much fun.

19:37.880 --> 19:43.300
This may have been the happiest day 
I've had in about fifty years.

19:43.300 --> 19:47.540
For me, too! I felt truly blessed today!

19:47.540 --> 19:52.200
I'll bring Sandra to visit you again, okay?

19:52.200 --> 19:54.800
Yes, you're welcome anytime.

19:55.100 --> 19:57.800
I'll buy you lots of clothes 
again next time, too!

19:57.800 --> 20:00.870
I don't think we'll need 
more for a while...

20:07.520 --> 20:11.140
There's just no better 
size to be than this.

20:12.340 --> 20:14.680
Last night sure was rough.

20:15.490 --> 20:18.770
Lady Azusa, you are absolutely the cutest!

20:19.130 --> 20:22.290
No, this outfit's even cuter!

20:22.290 --> 20:25.170
No, no! This one's cuter!

20:25.170 --> 20:28.290
You Red Dragons must be blind!

20:30.920 --> 20:36.190
I wonder what would happen if she ate 
another gnome-maker mushroom in this state!

20:36.190 --> 20:38.890
She'd be beyond adorable!

20:38.890 --> 20:42.140
Sister, why don't you stay 
like this for a while?

20:43.290 --> 20:46.470
Okay, enough already!

20:47.050 --> 20:50.070
Thank goodness I made it back to normal.

20:53.050 --> 20:55.180
Yeah, that's right! That's right!

20:55.520 --> 20:58.190
Stick to your own pace.

21:01.190 --> 21:03.560
I did it! It says "apple"!

21:03.560 --> 21:05.360
Good job!

21:05.360 --> 21:07.810
You can show this off at school.

21:07.810 --> 21:09.700
I don't need school anymore.

21:09.700 --> 21:10.450
Huh?

21:10.450 --> 21:13.450
Sandra, you're not going back to school?

21:13.690 --> 21:16.250
I can study just as well here at home.

21:16.250 --> 21:19.830
Besides... I want to spend more time here.

21:22.610 --> 21:25.100
Wh-Why are you laughing?!

21:25.420 --> 21:26.920
No reason!

21:31.140 --> 21:33.970
Okay, hurry up and give me the next lesson!

21:34.350 --> 21:39.460
<i>And so Sandra graduated from school, too.</i>

23:09.950 --> 23:12.450
<b>Days in the Highlands</b>

23:10.240 --> 23:12.440
Days in the Highlands!

23:12.440 --> 23:15.340
Don't follow any men, okay?

23:15.340 --> 23:17.320
You don't want weird pests clinging to you.

23:17.320 --> 23:20.210
Oh, no! A weird pest's on Sandra!

23:20.210 --> 23:21.700
What?!

23:21.700 --> 23:24.200
It just won't get off of me.

23:24.200 --> 23:26.160
That's an <i>actual</i> weird bug!

23:26.710 --> 23:28.470
<b>Part 2</b>

23:26.720 --> 23:28.470
Part 2!

23:28.860 --> 23:32.200
It looks like I got your 
clothes all wet, Azusa.

23:32.200 --> 23:34.090
I'll absorb it.

23:36.960 --> 23:38.250
Precious!

23:38.250 --> 23:39.780
Momma Yufufu?!
